{"product_id":"teach-your-child-to-sleep-solving-sleep-problems-from-newborn-through-childhood","title":"Teach Your Child to Sleep: Solving Sleep Problems from Newborn Through Childhood","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen a baby doesn't sleep well, the entire family suffers. Now, parents and children can sleep soundly through the night using these proven and effective methods from one of Europe's preeminent sleep clinics. Covering a range of common scenarios, parents will learn to identify the root cause of their child's sleepless nights and take simple steps to correct the situation--and can see results in as little as two to three weeks! The most frequent sleep problems and their causes are detailed, and parents also will find pros and cons of popular sleep techniques, as well as tips for encouraging good sleeping habits.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 165 x 235\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Millpond Sleep Clinic\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780600613459\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 528\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45199411609753,"sku":"9RG9780600613459","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67c9ba3967628_Teach_20Your_20Child_20to_20Sleep-_20Solving_20Sleep_20Problems_20from_20Newborn_20Through_20Childhood_20Millpond_20Sleep_20Clinic.jpg?v=1741354658","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/teach-your-child-to-sleep-solving-sleep-problems-from-newborn-through-childhood","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}